WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:02.680
Pop! Pop!

2
00:00:02.681 --> 00:00:05.674
It was a nice day at the reef.

3
00:00:05.675 --> 00:00:09.000
Cora and Mo were popping seaweed bubbles.

4
00:00:09.001 --> 00:00:15.614
"This is fun!" Cora popped some more.

5
00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:18.710
Mo popped some bubbles with his spikes.

6
00:00:18.711 --> 00:00:21.937
"Ouch!" someone cried.

7
00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:25.405
"That sounds like Rita," Cora said.

8
00:00:25.406 --> 00:00:30.233
"It is me," the stingray whispered.

9
00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:33.350
Rita was hiding in the sand.

10
00:00:33.351 --> 00:00:38.029
"What are you doing, Rita?" Cora said.

11
00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:42.549
"I saw a hammerhead!" Rita whispered.

12
00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:46.590
"I'm scared of hammerheads."

13
00:00:46.591 --> 00:00:50.249
Mo gulped. "Me too.

14
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:54.079
Hammerheads are big—and hungry!"

15
00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:58.085
"It will scare everyone at the reef!" Cora said.

16
00:00:58.086 --> 00:01:00.471
"We need to chase it away."

17
00:01:00.472 --> 00:01:04.871
"But how?" Rita asked.

18
00:01:04.872 --> 00:01:11.158
Mo took a deep breath. "Maybe I can try."

19
00:01:11.159 --> 00:01:14.677
He tried to grow big and spiky.

20
00:01:14.678 --> 00:01:19.041
Mo flipped over. "Oops."

21
00:01:19.042 --> 00:01:22.478
He floated with his belly up.

22
00:01:22.479 --> 00:01:25.697
"It's okay, Mo," Cora said.

23
00:01:25.698 --> 00:01:32.994
"Let's see if the compass can help!"

24
00:01:32.995 --> 00:01:36.987
"Come back soon!" Rita said.

25
00:01:36.988 --> 00:01:41.699
She dug under the sand again.

26
00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:48.615
Cora and Mo swam to the cave.

27
00:01:48.616 --> 00:01:51.274
Cora shot ink at the shell.

28
00:01:51.275 --> 00:01:55.715
Her ink was blue again.

29
00:01:55.716 --> 00:01:59.907
But would the shell open?

